export anchor PrivateBankStyle:
    number: 49
    screen: Pricing
    name: Private bank
    idea: A conservative wealth-management letterhead in navy and ivory, with engraved serif capitals, a thin gold rule and a framed schedule of fees in a formal voice.
    base: light
    palette:
        ivory: #f8f4ea, the page
        vellum: #fffdf7, the plan frame and the style sheet ground
        navy: #13254a, text, rules, the primary button and the featured Team column
        slate: #5a6378, captions, italic notes and meta text
        gold: #a8843c, thin rules, the inner frame line and the focus halo, decoration only
        goldInk: #7a5c22, small gold capital labels on ivory
        paleGold: #c9a75a, gold accents and roman numerals on navy
        hairline: #d9d0bc, row dividers
        ledgerGreen: #1f5a3a, included ticks in the table
    type:
        Display is Didot, Bodoni 72, Bodoni MT, Baskerville, Times New Roman,
        serif, always uppercase with wide tracking. Text is Baskerville,
        Hoefler Text, Georgia, serif. Sizes are 52px for the page title at
        0.14em tracking, 56px regular lining figures for prices, 26px plan
        names at 0.24em, 17px body on a 1.6 line, 15px italic notes and
        12px capital labels at 0.22em.
    layout:
        A centred letterhead with a monogram crest in a double circle, the
        brand in spaced capitals and a small capital nav, closed by a double
        gold rule. Below sit a small gold overline, the title, an italic
        lede, a diamond flourish and a square two part billing switch with
        the free months note in italic gold. The three plans share one
        certificate frame, a navy line with a gold line inset 6px, split
        into columns by hairlines. Team is a solid navy column with the
        Most popular label sitting on the top frame edge. Each plan shows a
        roman numeral, the name, a short gold rule, the price, an italic
        billing line, a dash list and a button. Then a comparison table with
        a tinted Team column and a centred list of questions with roman
        numerals. Below 900px the plans stack inside the same frame.
    spacing: An 8px unit. 36 to 40px inside plans and 72 to 88px between sections.
    density: Sparse. Few words per line with generous leading.
    corners: None. Every edge is square.
    borders: A double frame of 1px navy then 1px gold. Hairlines between rows and a 1px navy rule under the table head and at its foot.
    shadows: None. Buttons carry an inset keyline in gold 3px inside the edge.
    icons:
        No pictograms. A monogram crest, a diamond flourish, roman
        numerals, em dashes as list marks, a tick and a dash in the table,
        and plus and minus on the questions. The billing switch shows a
        filled diamond on the chosen option.
    focus: A 1px navy outline offset 4px with a 1px gold halo outside it. A focused field gets a 2px gold underline on white.
    tone: Formal and measured, such as Schedule of fees, Particulars and Questions answered.
